Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(llm-pi-ai): handle image offload and
 finish_reason-less streams

- adapter: strip in-history images for text-only models, keep fresh image rejection, pass sanitized messages to toPiContext with maxRequestImageBytes
- stream: treat content-bearing stream without finish_reason as stop/tool-calls (OpenCode Zen Go gateway ends with {choices:[],cost:0})
- tests: add coverage for stream ended without finish_reason
